{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/12902daffde9b84afcdc7665e3c0c51c.avif?t=1766147641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras_big/12902daffde9b84afcdc7665e3c0c51c.avif?t=1766147641 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Winner of three BAFTA Games Awards: Best New IP; Performer in a Leading Role; Performer in a Supporting Role</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>STILL WAKES THE DEEP</strong></i> is a return to the first-person narrative horror genre for The Chinese Room, creator of critically acclaimed games such as <i>Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs</i>, <i>Everybody\u2019s Gone to the Rapture</i>, and <i>Dear Esther</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an offshore oil rig worker, fighting for his life through a vicious storm, perilous surroundings, and the dark, freezing North Sea waters. All lines of communication have been severed. All exits are gone. All that remains is to face the unknowable horror that\u2019s come aboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/29a96c2104d1158183e72146f90f7bc3.poster.avif?t=1766147641\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/29a96c2104d1158183e72146f90f7bc3.webm?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/29a96c2104d1158183e72146f90f7bc3.mp4?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for your crew and help them survive if you can. Run, climb, and swim through the flooding corridors and storm-lashed outer decks. Face a terrifying, unrelenting foe. And pray that, one day, you get to see your family again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chinese Room \u2013 with its reputation for world-class world-building, audio, writing, and acting \u2013 delivers a symphony of action, trepidation, tender emotions, and awe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIVE THE HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive disaster story aboard a stunningly realised North Sea oil rig, starring an authentic cast of Scottish actors. Experience the beauty and ferocity of the sea as it rips apart one of humanity\u2019s strongest structures and its steadfast crew. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/51aee519736638591bd054865b4c7844.poster.avif?t=1766147641\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/51aee519736638591bd054865b4c7844.webm?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/51aee519736638591bd054865b4c7844.mp4?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE RIG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons. No powers. Just your wits and determination. Struggle for survival on an unstable oil rig, where one wrong step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/0ce6c103402c1ea134aa2d29c328f309.poster.avif?t=1766147641\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/0ce6c103402c1ea134aa2d29c328f309.webm?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/0ce6c103402c1ea134aa2d29c328f309.mp4?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has turned your home into a nightmare, where the familiar becomes threatening, and where a noise in the dark fills you with dread. Resist the urge to turn back. Confront the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/3d565fb73ab301a0aed5035c4dc2a119.poster.avif?t=1766147641\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/3d565fb73ab301a0aed5035c4dc2a119.webm?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/3d565fb73ab301a0aed5035c4dc2a119.mp4?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an authentic oil rig in 1970\u2019s Scotland that evolves throughout the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World-class visuals, audio, and writing from award-winning studio The Chinese Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star-studded cast of voice-actors: Alec Newman (BAFTA winning role), Karen Dunbar (BAFTA winning role), Michael Abubakar (BAFTA nominated role) Neve McIntosh (Golden Joystick Award nominated role), and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting soundtrack by BAFTA winning composer Jason Graves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated with new features including Chapter Select, Yellow Markers toggle, and Silver Screen cinematic filter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Story Mode available for players who wish to reduce the threat </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All Beans and Forgiveness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622910/ccb3fee63add519f20e75b59f11d0606ad2e505a.jpg"},{"name":"The Sickening of the Calm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622910/e39d706623da2abc043855fb12d888fb2ca59207.jpg"},{"name":"Breathe In, Breathe Out, Repeat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622910/c3bb6bd870de6bf652a84a935fdcd304d5ec2028.jpg"},{"name":"Home by Christmas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622910/e2f7cc85ac0cf566b30d9f70afb4b1c9a85fed12.jpg"},{"name":"Eye of the Needle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622910/75c367708dc0bc86b41f36f84830ae01713f2021.jpg"},{"name":"Everything Breaks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622910/1e189ac332be1ef54c21e1a4a3d512cf4712ba00.jpg"},{"name":"I Am The King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622910/1cbb2c5f2d759890cb14c03bb647ce0bb37c688e.jpg"},{"name":"Compression Ignition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622910/69c1e7e992371bc31aaa656d168b51c3e6c773f2.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Belly of the Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622910/50e7a12b3d11375d94b232e2cd9fc06c11a43456.jpg"},{"name":"Surfacing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622910/30292bb50e83ffbf34f7968a240c97a947587b04.jpg"}],"total":59},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1622910?t=1766147641","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/581465fa2e5a0405bfb45dbd1844ea25e6a59c94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766147641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/74e6db81ddca29fc1c07caee1e4abf9188b6aa84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766147641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/74e6db81ddca29fc1c07caee1e4abf9188b6aa84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766147641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game includes Mature content such as \u201cBlood and Gore,\u201d \u201cPartial Nudity,\u201d \u201cStrong Language,\u201d and \u201cViolence\u201d."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/12902daffde9b84afcdc7665e3c0c51c.avif?t=1766147641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras_big/12902daffde9b84afcdc7665e3c0c51c.avif?t=1766147641 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Winner of three BAFTA Games Awards: Best New IP; Performer in a Leading Role; Performer in a Supporting Role</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>STILL WAKES THE DEEP</strong></i> is a return to the first-person narrative horror genre for The Chinese Room, creator of critically acclaimed games such as <i>Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs</i>, <i>Everybody\u2019s Gone to the Rapture</i>, and <i>Dear Esther</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an offshore oil rig worker, fighting for his life through a vicious storm, perilous surroundings, and the dark, freezing North Sea waters. All lines of communication have been severed. All exits are gone. All that remains is to face the unknowable horror that\u2019s come aboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/29a96c2104d1158183e72146f90f7bc3.poster.avif?t=1766147641\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/29a96c2104d1158183e72146f90f7bc3.webm?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/29a96c2104d1158183e72146f90f7bc3.mp4?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for your crew and help them survive if you can. Run, climb, and swim through the flooding corridors and storm-lashed outer decks. Face a terrifying, unrelenting foe. And pray that, one day, you get to see your family again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chinese Room \u2013 with its reputation for world-class world-building, audio, writing, and acting \u2013 delivers a symphony of action, trepidation, tender emotions, and awe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIVE THE HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive disaster story aboard a stunningly realised North Sea oil rig, starring an authentic cast of Scottish actors. Experience the beauty and ferocity of the sea as it rips apart one of humanity\u2019s strongest structures and its steadfast crew. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/51aee519736638591bd054865b4c7844.poster.avif?t=1766147641\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/51aee519736638591bd054865b4c7844.webm?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/51aee519736638591bd054865b4c7844.mp4?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE RIG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons. No powers. Just your wits and determination. Struggle for survival on an unstable oil rig, where one wrong step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/0ce6c103402c1ea134aa2d29c328f309.poster.avif?t=1766147641\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/0ce6c103402c1ea134aa2d29c328f309.webm?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/0ce6c103402c1ea134aa2d29c328f309.mp4?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has turned your home into a nightmare, where the familiar becomes threatening, and where a noise in the dark fills you with dread. Resist the urge to turn back. Confront the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/3d565fb73ab301a0aed5035c4dc2a119.poster.avif?t=1766147641\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/3d565fb73ab301a0aed5035c4dc2a119.webm?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/extras/3d565fb73ab301a0aed5035c4dc2a119.mp4?t=1766147641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an authentic oil rig in 1970\u2019s Scotland that evolves throughout the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World-class visuals, audio, and writing from award-winning studio The Chinese Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star-studded cast of voice-actors: Alec Newman (BAFTA winning role), Karen Dunbar (BAFTA winning role), Michael Abubakar (BAFTA nominated role) Neve McIntosh (Golden Joystick Award nominated role), and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting soundtrack by BAFTA winning composer Jason Graves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated with new features including Chapter Select, Yellow Markers toggle, and Silver Screen cinematic filter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Story Mode available for players who wish to reduce the threat </p></li></ul>","developers":["The Chinese Room"],"dlc":[3465690,3049220],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622910/4922a49a07bf4f